{
  "file": "module5",
  "page": 49,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.5191040039062,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "The decision to start treatment is linked to other recommendations in these guidelines, such as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.1897583007812,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "shortening of the treatment duration for children with non-severe forms of TB and on decentralization",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969657897949219,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.3871459960938,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "of TB services. Once a decision to start TB treatment has been made, the severity of disease needs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4321899414062,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "to be assessed to inform the duration of treatment. Detailed criteria for assessing severity of disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        272.2343444824219,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "are described in the operational handbook.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.71859741210938,
        527.3966674804688,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "Referral:  Defining the criteria for referral of children evaluated for PTB at peripheral levels of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.2395629882812,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "health care system using the algorithms is important. Examples of subgroups in need of referral",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.4365234375,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "include infants, children with presumptive severe forms of EPTB (such as TBM, disseminated TB and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.3839721679688,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "osteoarticular TB) and children with presumptive DR-TB in regions with a high prevalence of DR-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69471740722656,
        527.4342651367188,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "Children presenting with severe acute pneumonia need referral to the appropriate level of care for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.4410400390625,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "oxygen supplementation, while children with SAM need to be provided with appropriate nutritional",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.5755615234375,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "support. A high index of suspicion is important among infants with acute symptoms who are contacts",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.984488487243652,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.5695190429688,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "of people with bacteriologically confirmed TB, to make a treatment decision as soon as possible rather",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970259666442871,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.3871459960938,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "than wait for symptoms to persist. This is due to the potential for rapid deterioration in the clinical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        343.7189025878906,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "condition of infants and development of severe TB disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.2226257324219,
        527.4309692382812,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "Clinical monitoring of children started on TB treatment : It is important to acknowledge that the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        527.4378662109375,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "preference for sufficient sensitivity of the algorithms to detect and treat children with TB will mean",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        524.363037109375,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "that some children who do not have TB will be treated with TB treatment. The risk of severe drug-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        458.9264831542969,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "related toxicity in children is very low, and shorter regimens for non-severe TB (see",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        459.4659118652344,
        321.99859619140625,
        503.52093505859375,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "chapter 5",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        503.5203857421875,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.4234008789062,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": ") will",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.13330078125,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "further reduce the risks related to treatment. However, it will be critical to monitor children started on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996149063110352,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        527.3969116210938,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "TB treatment and to refer them for evaluation for other diseases and appropriate treatment if they",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        289.0973205566406,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "fail to respond to TB treatment within 1 month.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.12652587890625,
        527.4264526367188,
        397.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "Implementation in high DR-TB burden settings:  Integrated treatment decision algorithms may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        396.5025939941406,
        527.3937377929688,
        410.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "be implemented in settings with a high burden of DR-TB. Seeking bacteriological confirmation using",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        409.7025146484375,
        524.3742065429688,
        424.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "appropriate paediatric samples and WHO recommended rapid diagnostic tests (such as Xpert MTB/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        422.9026184082031,
        527.555419921875,
        437.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "RIF or Ultra) is critical among children who have a history of contact with a source case with confirmed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976625442504883,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        436.10260009765625,
        527.3311767578125,
        450.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "or highly likely DR-TB (including a TB patient not responding to treatment, or a source case who died",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993947982788086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        449.3025207519531,
        527.4727783203125,
        463.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "of TB while on treatment). Once a decision to treat a child without bacteriological confirmation for TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993147850036621,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        462.5025939941406,
        527.3663940429688,
        476.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "has been made based on the algorithm, risk factors for the child having DR-TB need to be assessed.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        475.7025146484375,
        527.4180908203125,
        490.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "Clinicians need to keep a high index of suspicion for DR-TB in these children and ensure they are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        488.9026184082031,
        308.36285400390625,
        503.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "tested and managed for DR-TB as appropriate (see",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        308.3652038574219,
        488.9026184082031,
        351.8587951660156,
        503.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "chapter 5",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.86029052734375,
        488.9026184082031,
        357.4042663574219,
        503.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": ").",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        516.69580078125,
        309.7701110839844,
        537.5758056640625
      ],
      "text": "4.2.4. Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        543.7796630859375,
        527.4431762695312,
        558.22265625
      ],
      "text": "The integrated treatment decision algorithms need to be monitored and evaluated for their impact",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        556.979736328125,
        283.01397705078125,
        571.4227294921875
      ],
      "text": "on case notifications and treatment outcomes.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        578.68359375,
        527.277099609375,
        593.1265869140625
      ],
      "text": "Clinical monitoring of people with TB started on treatment based on clinical criteria is equally important,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.8837280273438,
        527.4420166015625,
        606.3267211914062
      ],
      "text": "such as the need to monitor response to treatment (to identify an alternative diagnosis for children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.083740234375,
        524.4041748046875,
        619.5267333984375
      ],
      "text": "who may be misdiagnosed as having TB), adverse events and deterioration in the clinical condition.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        325.393798828125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "4. Diagnostic approaches for TB in children and adolescents 25",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}